ansmitters as receiving an equal same-fit return stream from a second identical hull. This currently adjusts only capacitor stability and depletion timing, not combat-kernel behavior.", "Combat remains an MVP duel kernel: deterministic application math, no random hit quality, no missile flight time, no capacitor warfare, and no full drone AI."]}, "issues": [], "warnings": []}